claim.claim-text:
- transmitting a notification from the server to the user device;
- receiving, by the server, a sentiment score that correlates with a reinforcement learning reward for training a reinforcement learning model implemented on the server; and
- training the reinforcement learning model implemented on the server based on the received sentiment score, preferably wherein the reinforcement learning model is trained based on maximizing a reward function of the reinforcement learning model implemented on the server.
